{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13529","headline":"玉壶冰 · 王季友","name":"玉壶冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉壶知素结，止水复中澄。\n坚白能虚受，清寒得自凝。\n分形同晓镜，照物掩宵灯。\n壁映圆光入，人惊爽气凌。\n金罍何足贵，瑶席几回升。\n正值求珪瓒，提携共饮冰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王季友","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}